{"Intent": "<b>SUBJECTIVE</b><br><span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Acute Symptoms</span><span style='color:#0288D1; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Personal Information</span><span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Personal History</span><span style='color:#EF6C00; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Family History</span><span style='color:#009688; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Drug History</span><span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Theraputic History</span><span style='color:#E91E63; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Vegetative History</span><span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Other Social</span>", "Note": "<ol><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>CHIEF COMPLAINT

Left knee pain.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#0288D1;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal Information'>Andrea Barnes is a 34-year-old female</span> <span style='color:#0288D1; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal Information</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>who presents today for evaluation of left knee pain.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>The patient has been experiencing intermittent episodes of pain and sudden instability with ambulation.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>Her pain is localized deep in her patella and occurs less than once daily.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>Due to the fleeting nature of these episodes, she has not taken medication and simply braces herself until it passes.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>She denies any trauma or injury, or ever hearing or feeling a pop in the knee.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#26C6DA;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Other Social'>Her symptoms do not interfere with her daily activities and she does not use a cane.</span> <span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Other Social</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>Regarding her hypertension, it has been several days since she last checked her blood pressure at home, but it was approximately 120/70 mmHg at that time.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>Her current medications include amlodipine, lisinopril, and hydrochlorothiazide, all of which she takes on a regular basis.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>In terms of her diabetes, her fasting morning blood glucose levels have been approximately 130 based on home monitoring.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>This is slightly higher than usual, even though she has been compliant with metformin and Farxiga.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>She does try to avoid eating late at night.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>MEDICAL HISTORY

Patient reports a personal history of hypertension and type 2 diabetes.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>Patient likes to travel and is planning a trip to Columbus, Georgia in the next month or so.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#26C6DA;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Other Social'>She is part of the Lion's Club.</span> <span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Other Social</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>Patient reports that she is taking amlodipine, lisinopril 20 mg once daily, hydrochlorothiazide, Metformin, and Farxiga.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>Musculoskeletal: Reports left knee pain and instability,</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li></ol>"}

{"Intent": "<b>SUBJECTIVE</b><br><span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Acute Symptoms</span><span style='color:#0288D1; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Personal Information</span><span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Personal History</span><span style='color:#EF6C00; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Family History</span><span style='color:#009688; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Drug History</span><span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Theraputic History</span><span style='color:#E91E63; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Vegetative History</span><span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Other Social</span>", "Note": "<ol><li><span style='color:#0288D1;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal Information'>CHIEF COMPLAINT

Back pain.</span> <span style='color:#0288D1; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal Information</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#0288D1;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal Information'>James Allen is a 57-year-old male</span> <span style='color:#0288D1; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal Information</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>with a past medical history significant for congestive heart failure and type 2 diabetes,</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>who presents today with back pain.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>The patient states he was golfing and hurt his back.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>This happened approximately 4 days ago when he felt a pop in his back.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>The patient notes that he immediately hit the ground trying to loosen up his back.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>He reports taking some Tylenol, ibuprofen, and using ice and heat which did not relieve the pain.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>By Monday morning it loosened up a little bit, but it is still pretty sore.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>He had some right lower extremity weakness and some drop foot that he felt that for a while, and it got a little better this morning but not much.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>He had surgery about 10 years ago in his lower back.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>Regarding his congestive heart failure, he has been watching his diet and trying to exercise regularly.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>He is avoiding the salty foods and has been compliant with medications.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#E91E63;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Vegetative History'>He has gained a little weight over the summer but nothing more than 5 pounds.</span> <span style='color:#E91E63; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Vegetative History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>He has no problems lying flat to go to bed.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>Regarding his diabetes, he is watching his blood sugars at home, not always consistently.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>He is still on his metformin.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#E91E63;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Vegetative History'>REVIEW OF SYSTEMS

• Constitutional: Denies weight loss. Endorses weight gain.</span> <span style='color:#E91E63; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Vegetative History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'> Musculoskeletal: Endorses back pain. Endorses right leg weakness and drop foot.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li></ol>"}

{"Intent": "<b>SUBJECTIVE</b><br><span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Acute Symptoms</span><span style='color:#0288D1; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Personal Information</span><span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Personal History</span><span style='color:#EF6C00; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Family History</span><span style='color:#009688; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Drug History</span><span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Theraputic History</span><span style='color:#E91E63; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Vegetative History</span><span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Other Social</span>", "Note": "<ol><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>CHIEF COMPLAINT

Hepatitis C.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#0288D1;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal Information'>Bruce Ward is a pleasant 60-year-old male</span> <span style='color:#0288D1; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal Information</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>who presents to the clinic today following a positive result in a hepatitis C antibody test.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>He was sent to obtain the hepatitis C antibody test as part of a routine physical.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#E91E63;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Vegetative History'>He states he is anxious with the results and denies he has ever been diagnosed with hepatitis C.</span> <span style='color:#E91E63; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Vegetative History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#009688;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Drug History'>The patient admits to intravenous drug use in the past; however, he notes it has been longer than 15 years since his last usage.</span> <span style='color:#009688; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Drug History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#009688;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Drug History'>He also reports a history of heavy alcohol use.</span> <span style='color:#009688; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Drug History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#009688;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Drug History'>He continues to drink a beer on occasion</span> <span style='color:#009688; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Drug History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#009688;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Drug History'>The patient currently smokes 1 to 2 cigarettes per day.</span> <span style='color:#009688; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Drug History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#009688;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Drug History'>He notes he used to smoke more and is having difficulty with complete cessation.</span> <span style='color:#009688; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Drug History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>MEDICAL HISTORY

The patient denies any significant past medical history.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#26C6DA;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Other Social'>The patient is married with children. </span> <span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Other Social</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#009688;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Drug History'>He reports history of IV drug use 15 years ago.</span> <span style='color:#009688; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Drug History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#009688;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Drug History'>He currently drinks beer occasionally</span> <span style='color:#009688; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Drug History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#009688;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Drug History'>The patient reports smoking 1 to 2 cigarettes per day.</span> <span style='color:#009688; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Drug History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#EF6C00;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Family History'>He reports a family history of high blood pressure, diabetes, and depression.</span> <span style='color:#EF6C00; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Family History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>Patient denies taking any current medications.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li></ol>"}

{"Intent": "<b>SUBJECTIVE</b><br><span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Acute Symptoms</span><span style='color:#0288D1; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Personal Information</span><span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Personal History</span><span style='color:#EF6C00; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Family History</span><span style='color:#009688; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Drug History</span><span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Theraputic History</span><span style='color:#E91E63; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Vegetative History</span><span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Other Social</span>", "Note": "<ol><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>CHIEF COMPLAINT

Right ankle pain.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#0288D1;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal Information'>Carolyn Jones is a pleasant 38-year-old female</span> <span style='color:#0288D1; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal Information</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>who presents to the clinic today for evaluation of right ankle pain.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>The patient sustained an injury to her right ankle when she slipped and fell on ice while taking her garbage out yesterday</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>This was her first right ankle injury</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>She believes she heard a pop at the time, but denies any associated numbness or tingling</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>Initially, she was unable to bear weight on the ankle and required help getting inside; however, she is now able to slightly bear weight but ambulates with an antalgic gait</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>Ice, elevation, and ibuprofen have been helpful at reducing her pain.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>She rates her current pain as 4/10, her pain without medication as 6/10, and her pain with medication as 1/10.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#26C6DA;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Other Social'>Of note, the patient participates in an intramural soccer league but has not been able to play since this injury.</span> <span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Other Social</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>he patient reports that she has had several ankle injuries in the past.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>This is her first right ankle injury.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#26C6DA;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Other Social'>he patient reports that she has a history of playing sports</span> <span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Other Social</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#26C6DA;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Other Social'>She played soccer in college and is now in an intramural soccer league.</span> <span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Other Social</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>The patient reports that she has been taking ibuprofen.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>Musculoskeletal: Reports right ankle pain.
Neurological: Denies right ankle numbness or tingling.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li></ol>"}

{"Intent": "<b>SUBJECTIVE</b><br><span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Acute Symptoms</span><span style='color:#0288D1; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Personal Information</span><span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Personal History</span><span style='color:#EF6C00; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Family History</span><span style='color:#009688; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Drug History</span><span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Theraputic History</span><span style='color:#E91E63; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Vegetative History</span><span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Other Social</span>", "Note": "<ol><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>CHIEF COMPLAINT

Bilateral knee pain.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#26C6DA;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Other Social'>The patient is an avid runner</span> <span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Other Social</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#26C6DA;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Other Social'>She also works from home.</span> <span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Other Social</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>Musculoskeletal: Reports bilateral knee pain. Denies knee swelling.
Skin: Denies redness.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li></ol>"}

