/b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>The patient states that he has been ambulating on his heel to keep his toe from bending.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>He reports that his pain is present even with the slightest of pressure, which he notes is worse at night when his sheet is touching his right toe</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>He adds that he has been taking 2 ibuprofen per day, which does not provide him with relief.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#26C6DA;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Other Social'>Patient reports that he likes to bicycle ride.</span> <span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Other Social</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>Musculoskeletal: Reports right great toe pain.
