Right knee injury.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#0288D1;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal Information'>William Russell is a pleasant 57-year-old male</span> <span style='color:#0288D1; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal Information</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>who presents to the clinic today for the evaluation of a right knee injury</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>He has a past medical history significant for hypertension and type 2 diabetes.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>Approximately 1 week ago, the patient sustained an injury to his right knee while at a trampoline park.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>He explains that he was jumping on a trampoline when he heard a snap, followed by instant pain in the lateral aspect of his knee.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>This is not a common activity for him, and he admits that he is inconsistent with exercise.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>As far as treatment, he has been elevating his knee and taking Tylenol without significant relief of his pain.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>He has not tried applying heat or ice to the area.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>In terms of his hypertension, the patient admits that he did not purchase a blood pressure cuff as previously recommended.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>While he does not monitor his blood pressures at home</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>he has been compliant with lisinopril 20 mg.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>His diabetes appears to be stable based on home monitoring, although he is only checking his blood glucose levels 4 to 5 times per week.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>He does not follow any specific diet plan, but he does try to make healthier choices such as limiting his carbohydrate intake.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>He has also been taking his metformin 500 mg as prescribed.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#E91E63;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Vegetative History'>REVIEW OF SYSTEMS

Musculoskeletal: Reports right knee pain.</span> <span style='color:#E91E63; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Vegetative History</b>)</span></li></ol>"}

