Follow up irritable bowel syndrome (IBS).</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#0288D1;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal Information'>Ms. Brittany Edwards is a pleasant 32-year-old female</span> <span style='color:#0288D1; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal Information</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>who returns in follow up for irritable bowel syndrome (IBS) with functional abdominal pain, nausea, and vomiting.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>Ms. Edwards was last seen in August 2019 with flares of abdominal pain and was diagnosed with irritable bowel syndrome</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>that was treated with Bentyl</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>She had a previous prescription for Reglan that she received from the emergency room that she used as needed for nausea</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>She was instructed to start a low dose fiber supplement such as Citrucel daily, probiotics to help with gas and bloating, and Bentyl up to 4 times daily for intestinal cramping</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>She was instructed to discontinue Reglan and to use Zofran as needed for nausea</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>Neuromodulators such as Elavil and Buspar were discussed but not started.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>Ms. Edwards continues to have intermittent abdominal symptoms</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>Monday through Thursday she has less flare ups of her symptoms but states she is currently having cramps and sharp pains.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>She describes she recently ate shrimp which caused her to have both upper and lower abdominal pain and bloating</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>However, she notices episodes of diarrhea after eating chicken alfredo</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#009688;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Drug History'>and consuming alcohol.</span> <span style='color:#009688; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Drug History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>She does not believe the alfredo contributes to her symptoms</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#009688;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Drug History'>The patient states she consumes 2 drinks when out of either tequila or brown liquor and occasionally a martini</span> <span style='color:#009688; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Drug History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'> She does her best to avoid âheavy foods,â but ate fried chicken today without any symptoms</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>She has stopped drinking sodas which has been helpful.â¯The patient reports passing 2-3 formed stools a day.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#E91E63;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Vegetative History'>REVIEW OF SYMPTOMS

