ize:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>The patient rates her pain level as 7 out of 10 at its worst.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>She reports the pain wakes her at night if she rolls over</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>She denies ibuprofen or ice provide pain relief</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>The patient denies any previous elbow injuries.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>The patient has a history of hypertension.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>She states she has been checking her blood pressures regularly</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>She adds that her blood pressures have been in the 110s to 130s range.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>She affirms she is taking lisinopril 10 mg daily and denies missing doses.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>Regarding her diabetes type 2, she reports she sometimes forgets to take metformin 500 mg twice daily</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>At times, her blood sugar levels range from 150 to 170 mg/dL</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>She states that she has a sweet tooth and indulges in home baked goods.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#26C6DA;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Other Social'>For exercise, she walks in the evening and in the morning</span> <span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Other Social</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#26C6DA;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Other Social'>She walks 1 to 2 miles per day around her neighborhood.</span> <span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Other Social</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#26C6DA;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Other Social'>The patient enjoys working with ceramics as well as baking cakes and cinnamon rolls for family gatherings.</span> <span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Other Social</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>Patient reports history of hypertension and diabetes type 2.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>Patient reports taking lisinopril 10 mg and metformin 500 mg twice daily.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#E91E63;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Vegetative History'>REVIEW OF SYSTEMS

