Non-healing right foot ulcer.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#0288D1;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal Information'>Christina Cooper is a pleasant 77-year-old female</span> <span style='color:#0288D1; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal Information</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>who presents to the clinic today for the evaluation of a non-healing right foot ulcer.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>The onset of her wound began 1 year ago with no specific injury</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>The patient states that it seemed like a blister and she picked at it where it then turned red</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>The patient was seen by her primary care physician</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>and was prescribed Keflex</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>She states that the antibiotics improved her symptoms, however they did not resolve them.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>The patient adds that she was last on Keflex 5 months ago</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>She denies any pain, however she reports decreased sensation in her foot</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#E91E63;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Vegetative History'>The patient also reports increased drainage and fatigue.</span> <span style='color:#E91E63; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Vegetative History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#26C6DA;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Other Social'>She states that she has been wearing her regular shoes.</span> <span style='color:#26C6DA; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Other Social</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>The patient has type 2 diabetes with neuropathy</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'>She states that her blood sugars are running better than they were; however, they are still in the 200's</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#673AB7;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Personal History'> Her last hemoglobin A1C was 10.</span> <span style='color:#673AB7; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Personal History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#E91E63;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Vegetative History'>REVIEW OF SYSTEMS

Constitutional: Reports fatigue.</span> <span style='color:#E91E63; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Vegetative History</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>Skin: Reports right foot ulcer and drainage.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li></ol>"}

